  "roacps": null,
  "General": {
    "Time": "2026-06-23T14:11:44.630Z",
    "Iscps": null,
    "Agency": "CW",
    "Author": "JamieCugler",
    "Source": "d1d7780d-a31a-4c23-826e-0495a64694bc",
    "Purpose": "247a8b26-cdee-4ce8-b36e-b37e49fd0103",
    "Lastname": "Price",
    "countyid": "1e886503-ef0a-450c-8607-566c45fa75e4",
    "Firstname": "Paula",
    "Narrative": "<p><strong>Email&nbsp;received&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;Somerset&nbsp;Co.&nbsp;District&nbsp;Court:</strong></p><p>Earlier&nbsp;this&nbsp;morning&nbsp;we&nbsp;had&nbsp;someone&nbsp;come&nbsp;in&nbsp;and&nbsp;filed&nbsp;a&nbsp;petition&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;protective&nbsp;order&nbsp;D-022-FM-26-821677,&nbsp;he&nbsp;alleged&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;respondent&nbsp;Jordan&nbsp;Alleman&nbsp;pulled&nbsp;a&nbsp;gun&nbsp;on&nbsp;him&nbsp;in&nbsp;front&nbsp;of&nbsp;their&nbsp;child&nbsp;in&nbsp;common.&nbsp;Just&nbsp;a&nbsp;couple&nbsp;minutes&nbsp;ago&nbsp;Jordan&nbsp;Alleman&nbsp;filed&nbsp;her&nbsp;own&nbsp;petition&nbsp;for&nbsp;Protective&nbsp;order,&nbsp;D-022-FM-26-821782,&nbsp;and&nbsp;alleged&nbsp;the&nbsp;respondent&nbsp;in&nbsp;that&nbsp;case&nbsp;Jeffrey&nbsp;Faber&nbsp;grabbed&nbsp;a&nbsp;kitchen&nbsp;knife&nbsp;and&nbsp;threaten&nbsp;to&nbsp;harm&nbsp;himself.&nbsp;Judge&nbsp;Price&nbsp;has&nbsp;asked&nbsp;us&nbsp;to&nbsp;forward&nbsp;to&nbsp;DSS&nbsp;as&nbsp;they&nbsp;are&nbsp;both&nbsp;have&nbsp;alleged&nbsp;concerning&nbsp;behavior&nbsp;around&nbsp;the&nbsp;child.&nbsp;The&nbsp;final&nbsp;hearing&nbsp;is&nbsp;set&nbsp;for&nbsp;June&nbsp;29,&nbsp;2026,&nbsp;9:00&nbsp;AM.&nbsp;Please&nbsp;see&nbsp;attached&nbsp;for&nbsp;both&nbsp;orders&nbsp;and&nbsp;petitions.&nbsp;Thank&nbsp;you.</p><p></p><p><strong>TPO&nbsp;#D-022-FM-26-821782&nbsp;Alleman&nbsp;vs&nbsp;Faber</strong></p><p>Petitioner&nbsp;(Alleman)&nbsp;alleged&nbsp;that&nbsp;respondent&nbsp;(Faber)&nbsp;pulled&nbsp;a&nbsp;knife&nbsp;threatening&nbsp;to&nbsp;harm&nbsp;himself&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;chased&nbsp;her&nbsp;with&nbsp;it.&nbsp;&nbsp;Jordan&nbsp;Alleman&nbsp;stated&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;TPO&nbsp;that&nbsp;on&nbsp;or&nbsp;about&nbsp;6/22/26&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;early&nbsp;morning&nbsp;she&nbsp;asked&nbsp;Jeffrey&nbsp;Faber&nbsp;to&nbsp;leave&nbsp;her&nbsp;property.&nbsp;&nbsp;Jeffrey&nbsp;took&nbsp;a&nbsp;kitchen&nbsp;knife&nbsp;and&nbsp;was&nbsp;trying&nbsp;to&nbsp;cut&nbsp;himself,&nbsp;he&nbsp;drove&nbsp;off&nbsp;and&nbsp;said&nbsp;he&nbsp;was&nbsp;going&nbsp;to&nbsp;kill&nbsp;himself,&nbsp;wrecked&nbsp;his&nbsp;company&nbsp;vehicle.Jordan&nbsp;also&nbsp;stated&nbsp;screaming&nbsp;and&nbsp;yelling&nbsp;from&nbsp;Jeffrey.&nbsp;MSP-26-020074.&nbsp;&nbsp;There&nbsp;was&nbsp;a&nbsp;protective&nbsp;order&nbsp;filed&nbsp;on&nbsp;6/19/24&nbsp;that&nbsp;ended.&nbsp;&nbsp;Jeffrey&nbsp;may&nbsp;have&nbsp;a&nbsp;“conceal&nbsp;and&nbsp;carry&nbsp;firearm”.</p><p></p><p><strong>TPO&nbsp;#D-022-FM-26-821677&nbsp;Faber&nbsp;vs.&nbsp;Alleman</strong></p><p>Petitioner&nbsp;(Faber)&nbsp;and&nbsp;respondent&nbsp;(Alleman)&nbsp;arguing,&nbsp;respondent&nbsp;pulled&nbsp;a&nbsp;pistol&nbsp;on&nbsp;petitioner,&nbsp;then&nbsp;put&nbsp;the&nbsp;pistol&nbsp;in&nbsp;his&nbsp;face&nbsp;again&nbsp;last&nbsp;night&nbsp;(6/21/26).&nbsp;Child&nbsp;in&nbsp;home&nbsp;at&nbsp;time.&nbsp;Respondent&nbsp;constantly&nbsp;drinking.&nbsp;&nbsp;Jordan&nbsp;owns&nbsp;a&nbsp;38-revolver&nbsp;weapon.&nbsp;&nbsp;Jeffrey&nbsp;Faber&nbsp;stated&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;TPO&nbsp;that&nbsp;two&nbsp;weeks&nbsp;ago&nbsp;Jordan&nbsp;Alleman&nbsp;went&nbsp;to&nbsp;Jeffrey’s&nbsp;residence&nbsp;and&nbsp;started&nbsp;a&nbsp;fight&nbsp;with&nbsp;his&nbsp;brother’s&nbsp;fiancé.&nbsp;&nbsp;The&nbsp;same&nbsp;night&nbsp;Jordan&nbsp;beat&nbsp;up&nbsp;Jeffrey&nbsp;and&nbsp;forced&nbsp;him&nbsp;to&nbsp;go&nbsp;with&nbsp;her&nbsp;where&nbsp;she&nbsp;then&nbsp;beat&nbsp;him&nbsp;up&nbsp;at&nbsp;her&nbsp;home.&nbsp;&nbsp;As&nbsp;of&nbsp;this&nbsp;morning&nbsp;(6/22/26)&nbsp;Jordan&nbsp;did&nbsp;it&nbsp;again&nbsp;but&nbsp;pulled&nbsp;out&nbsp;a&nbsp;gun.&nbsp;&nbsp;Jeffrey&nbsp;reported&nbsp;history&nbsp;of&nbsp;injuries&nbsp;(hit&nbsp;in&nbsp;???,&nbsp;hit&nbsp;with&nbsp;chair,&nbsp;scratched&nbsp;???,&nbsp;punched&nbsp;in&nbsp;face,&nbsp;and&nbsp;held&nbsp;at&nbsp;gunpoint).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p></p><p>Final&nbsp;hearing&nbsp;scheduled&nbsp;for&nbsp;6/29/26&nbsp;at&nbsp;9&nbsp;am.</p><p></p><p>Jeremy&nbsp;Faber&nbsp;9/22/21&nbsp;-&nbsp;LITTLE&nbsp;CHILD&nbsp;FARM&nbsp;CARE,&nbsp;PINE&nbsp;STREET,&nbsp;PRINCESS&nbsp;ANNE,&nbsp;MD,&nbsp;21853</p><p>Jordan&nbsp;Nicole&nbsp;Alleman&nbsp;12/18/97&nbsp;–&nbsp;works&nbsp;at&nbsp;Hebron&nbsp;Savings&nbsp;Bank,&nbsp;Princess&nbsp;Anne</p><p>Jeffrey&nbsp;Faber&nbsp;8/4/97&nbsp;–&nbsp;living&nbsp;at&nbsp;brother’s&nbsp;house-13318&nbsp;Pine&nbsp;Branch&nbsp;Rd.,&nbsp;Princess&nbsp;Anne,&nbsp;MD,&nbsp;443-949-5522&nbsp;–&nbsp;works&nbsp;at&nbsp;coastal&nbsp;bath&nbsp;Monday&nbsp;thru&nbsp;Friday</p>",
    "AgencyCode": "CW",
